  "body": "TWO BRAND-NEW HOMES. ONE SOUGHT-AFTER MILFORD ADDRESS. YOUR CHOICE!\r\n\r\n8B & 8D | Freehold | Standalone | 4 Bedrooms | 3 Bathrooms | 2 Ensuites | Double Westlake Zone\r\n\r\nWhy settle for an ordinary new build when you can have your own freestanding home, four generous bedrooms, two private master suites and one of the North Shore's most desirable school zones?\r\n\r\nWelcome to 8B and 8D — two beautifully crafted, brand-new standalone homes in the heart of Milford, where contemporary design, quality finishes and an unbeatable location come together. Whether you're upsizing, looking for a low-maintenance family home or securing your future in the prestigious Double Westlake zone, these homes deserve a spot at the very top of your viewing list!\r\n\r\nTWO BEAUTIFUL HOMES. WHICH ONE WILL YOU CALL YOURS?\r\n\r\n8B: Approx. 174m² floor area | 135m² freehold land\r\n\r\n8D: Approx. 175m² floor area | 135m² freehold land\r\n\r\nBoth homes offer four bedrooms, three bathrooms, two private ensuites and internal-access garaging, thoughtfully arranged across three levels to create the perfect balance of style, privacy and everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nSPACE TO LIVE. PRIVACY TO RELAX. QUALITY TO ENJOY.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a layout designed around the way modern families actually live.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features two versatile bedrooms, perfect for growing children, visiting family, teenagers seeking their own space or a comfortable work-from-home setup.\r\n\r\nHead upstairs and you'll find the heart of the home — a beautifully presented, light-filled open-plan living and dining area that feels instantly welcoming. The sleek contemporary kitchen is ready to impress, featuring premium Fisher & Paykel appliances, including an integrated refrigerator and dishwasher, combining elegant design with everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nSlide open the doors to your sunny balcony, where morning coffees, weekend catch-ups and relaxed evenings become part of your daily routine.\r\n\r\nAnd the best part? The top floor is dedicated to privacy and comfort, featuring TWO master bedrooms, each with its own private ensuite. It's an incredibly practical arrangement for extended families, older children or anyone who appreciates having a little extra personal space.\r\n\r\nAdd the convenience of internal-access garaging, modern finishes and easy-care surroundings, and you've got a home that looks fantastic without demanding your weekends for maintenance.\r\n\r\nMILFORD LIFESTYLE. DOUBLE WESTLAKE ADVANTAGE.\r\n\r\nThe address alone is a reason to fall in love!\r\n\r\nMilford has long been one of Auckland's most desirable North Shore neighbourhoods, and it's easy to see why. From beachside walks and lively local cafés to boutique shopping and excellent schools, everything that makes everyday living enjoyable is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to:\r\n\r\n• Milford Beach – beautiful coastal walks and relaxed weekends by the water.\r\n\r\n• Milford Shopping Centre – supermarkets, boutique shops, cafés and restaurants.\r\n\r\n• Lake Pupuke and Takapuna – recreation, dining and the best of the North Shore lifestyle.\r\n\r\n• North Shore Hospital – a particularly convenient location for healthcare professionals.\r\n\r\n• Double Westlake school zone – zoned for the highly regarded Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School, along with Milford School.\r\n\r\nFor families who value education, location and long-term lifestyle, this is an address that ticks so many boxes.\r\n\r\nTWO HOMES. TWO OPPORTUNITIES. ONE SMART MOVE.\r\n\r\nBrand-new, freehold, standalone and beautifully appointed in sought-after Milford — 8B and 8D deliver the space your family needs, the quality you'll appreciate and the location you'll love coming home to.\r\n\r\nWhy just read about them when you can experience them for yourself?\r\n\r\nCome and explore both homes, compare the layouts and discover which one feels right for you.\r\n\r\nContact Lisa Zheng today to arrange your private viewing. Your next chapter in Milford could start right here!",
